    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winter's Wrath</strong> throws you into a brutal fight for survival in the heart of an ice-covered world.<br>In this frozen age, waves of dark creatures, towering ice beasts, and ancient legends come to life to challenge your defenses. Only clever strategy and fearless tactics can hold back the cold\u2014and the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this challenging <strong>tower defense</strong> game, place and upgrade your towers to fend off relentless waves of foes. With limited resources, every decision matters. The frost is unforgiving\u2014so must be your defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2744\ufe0f Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique towers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mythical ice creatures and boss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep strategy with resource management and wave scaling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winter's Wrath</strong> is more than a defense game\u2014it's a battle for survival against the wrath of winter itself.<br>Prepare your towers. Embrace the cold. Defend the last warmth of civilization!</p>",
